# The Last Agni Kai: Grizzly Bears (2/2) fights Phyrexian Walker (0/3): 2 damage is less than lethal, so there is no excess damage and
# no mana is added, and the Walker survives with 2 damage. The unspent {R} Black Lotus left over is still kept into the next step by the
# second sentence's effect, which does not depend on the fight.

